---
/**
 * A small serif "Y" for the corner of the navy panel. It is drawn as type, not Yale's official
 * logo artwork, so the site does not present itself as an official Yale page.
 */
---

<span class="ymark" aria-hidden="true">Y</span>

<style>
  .ymark {
    position: absolute;
    right: 22px;
    bottom: 18px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    font-family: var(--serif);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 1;
    padding-top: 2px;
    user-select: none;
  }
</style>
